.TH TERMEXPLORER 1 "November 2026" "TermExplorer 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
termexplorer \- terminal developer workstation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B termexplorer
.RI [ directory ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B termexplorer
is a Rust terminal application for file exploration, contextual previews, editing and developer workflows.
.PP
An optional directory argument selects the initial working directory.
.SH OPTIONS
The command-line options supported by the installed build are shown by:
.B termexplorer --help
.SH SEE ALSO
Project documentation: https://github.com/jyothiprajith1323/TermExplorer
